#: ../../source/design.rst:2
msgid "Design"
msgstr "设计"

#: ../../source/design.rst:8
msgid "Standards and conventions"
msgstr "标准与约定"

#: ../../source/design.rst:11
msgid "Packages"
msgstr "包"

#: ../../source/design.rst:13
msgid "All data in PartCAD is bundled into 'packages'."
msgstr "PartCAD 中的所有数据都被捆绑到“包”中。"

#: ../../source/design.rst:15
msgid ""
"Packages are organized in a hierarchical structure where some packages "
"may define \"dependencies\" that become \"child\" packages. The top-level"
" package is called \"//\". If a package called \"//package\" has a "
"dependency called \"sub-package\" then such a sub-package will be called "
"\"//package/sub-package\"."
msgstr "包以层级结构组织，其中某些包可以定义“依赖项”，这些依赖项会成为“子”包。顶层包称为“//”。如果一个名为“//package”的包有一个名为“sub-package”的依赖项，那么这样的子包将被称为“//package/sub-package”。"

#: ../../source/design.rst:21
msgid ""
"Each package is described using the configuration file ``partcad.yaml`` "
"placed in the package folder."
msgstr "每个包都由放置在包目录中的配置文件 ``partcad.yaml`` 来描述。"

#: ../../source/design.rst:25
msgid "Sketches"
msgstr "草图"

#: ../../source/design.rst:27
msgid ""
"PartCAD uses 2D sketches to create 3D models (e.g. via `extrude` or "
"`sweep`) and to maintain various metadata (such as the geometry of "
"interfaces between parts, arbitrary part metadata like camera view angles"
" and so on)."
msgstr "PartCAD 使用 2D 草图来创建 3D 模型（例如通过 `extrude` 或 `sweep` ），并维护各种元数据（例如零件之间接口的几何形状，以及诸如相机视角之类的任意零件元数据等）。"

#: ../../source/design.rst:31
msgid "Basic shapes"
msgstr "基本形状"

#: ../../source/design.rst:33
msgid "Outer shape: `circle`, `rectangle`, `square`"
msgstr "外部形状： `circle` 、 `rectangle` 、 `square`"

#: ../../source/design.rst:34
msgid "Optional inner shape: `circle`, `rectangle`, `square`"
msgstr "可选的内部形状： `circle` 、 `rectangle` 、 `square`"

