#: ../../source/design.rst:87
msgid "Assemblies"
msgstr "装配体"

#: ../../source/design.rst:89
msgid ""
"Assemblies are parametrized instructions on how to put parts and other "
"assemblies together."
msgstr "装配体是关于如何将零件和其他装配体组合到一起的参数化说明。"

#: ../../source/design.rst:92
msgid ""
"PartCAD is expected to have an ever-growing list of ways to define "
"assemblies using existing parts. However, at the moment, only one way is "
"supported. It is called ASSY: assembly YAML. The idea behind ASSY is to "
"create a simplistic way to enumerate parts, define their parameters and "
"define how parts connect."
msgstr "预计 PartCAD 使用现有零件定义装配体的方式会不断增加。不过，目前仅支持一种方式，称为 ASSY：assembly YAML。ASSY 背后的理念是提供一种极其简单的方式来枚举零件、定义它们的参数并定义零件之间如何连接。"

#: ../../source/design.rst:100
msgid "Scenes"
msgstr "场景"

#: ../../source/design.rst:102
msgid ""
"PartCAD does not yet implement scenes. But the idea is to be able to "
"reproduce the same features as worlds in Gazebo to the extent that "
"PartCAD scenes can be exported to and simulated in Gazebo, but without "
"using XML while creating the scene."
msgstr "PartCAD 尚未实现场景功能。但其设想是能够重现与 Gazebo 中的世界（world）相同的特性，使 PartCAD 场景可以导出到 Gazebo 中并在其中进行仿真，同时在创建场景时无需使用 XML。"

#: ../../source/design.rst:108
msgid "Monorepos"
msgstr "单体仓库（Monorepo）"

#: ../../source/design.rst:110
msgid ""
"When PartCAD is initialized, the current folder and its ``partcad.yaml`` "
"become the `current` package, but not the `root` package. The root "
"package is discovered by traversing the parent directories for as long as"
" there is another ``partcad.yaml`` found there."
msgstr "当 PartCAD 初始化时，当前目录及其 ``partcad.yaml`` 会成为 `current` （当前）包，但不会成为 `root` （根）包。根包是通过向上遍历父目录来发现的，只要在其中还能找到另一个 ``partcad.yaml`` ，就继续向上查找。"

#: ../../source/design.rst:115
msgid ""
"This allows to run PartCAD tools from any sub-directory in a monorepo "
"project while maintaining the same meaning of relative and absolute "
"paths."
msgstr "这使得你可以在单体仓库项目的任意子目录中运行 PartCAD 工具，同时保持相对路径和绝对路径的含义不变。"

#: ../../source/design.rst:119
msgid "Paths"
msgstr "路径"

#: ../../source/design.rst:121
msgid ""
"PartCAD uses package paths to identify packages and parts declared in "
"them."
msgstr "PartCAD 使用包路径来标识包以及在其中声明的零件。"

#: ../../source/design.rst:123
msgid ""
"The current package has the path ``\"\"`` or ``\".\"``. The root package "
"has the path ``\"//\"``. For any package ``\"<package-path>\"``, each "
"sub-directory containing ``partcad.yaml`` and each ``import``-ed "
"dependency becomes ``\"<package-path>/<sub-package>\"``."
msgstr "当前包的路径为 ``\"\"`` 或 ``\".\"`` 。根包的路径为 ``\"//\"`` 。对于任意包 ``\"<package-path>\"`` ，其中每个包含 ``partcad.yaml`` 的子目录、以及每个通过 ``import`` 导入的依赖项，都会成为 ``\"<package-path>/<sub-package>\"`` 。"

#: ../../source/design.rst:130
msgid "Absolute vs relative"
msgstr "绝对路径与相对路径"

#: ../../source/design.rst:132
msgid ""
"The absolute package path is the path from the root package to the "
"package. If the path starts with ``\"//\"`` then it is an absolute path."
msgstr "绝对包路径是从根包到该包的路径。如果路径以 ``\"//\"`` 开头，那么它就是绝对路径。"

#: ../../source/design.rst:135
msgid ""
"The relative package path is the path from the current package to the "
"package. If the path does not start with ``\"//\"`` then it is a relative"
" path. Sometimes it might help to disambiguate the relative path by "
"prepending ``\"./\"``."
msgstr "相对包路径是从当前包到该包的路径。如果路径不以 ``\"//\"`` 开头，那么它就是相对路径。有时在前面加上 ``\"./\"`` 有助于消除相对路径的歧义。"

#: ../../source/design.rst:140
msgid "Multiple packages"
msgstr "多个包"

#: ../../source/design.rst:142
msgid ""
"Some PartCAD commands and interfaces allow referencing multiple packages "
"at once. ``\"<package-path>/\\*\"`` is a reference to all sub-packages in"
" ``\"<package-path>\"``."
msgstr "某些 PartCAD 命令和接口允许一次性引用多个包。 ``\"<package-path>/\\*\"`` 表示对 ``\"<package-path>\"`` 中所有子包的引用。"

#: ../../source/design.rst:145
msgid ""
"``\"<package-path>/...\"`` is a reference to ``\"<package-path>\"`` and "
"to all of its sub-packages."
msgstr "``\"<package-path>/...\"`` 表示对 ``\"<package-path>\"`` 及其所有子包的引用。"

#: ../../source/design.rst:149
msgid "Object IDs"
msgstr "对象 ID"

#: ../../source/design.rst:151
msgid ""
"PartCAD packages contain objects of different types: *sketches*, *parts*,"
" *assemblies*, *scenes*, *interfaces*, *providers* and so on. All of them"
" need to get referenced."
msgstr "PartCAD 包中包含不同类型的对象： *草图* 、 *零件* 、 *装配体* 、 *场景* 、 *接口* 、 *提供方* 等等。所有这些对象都需要被引用。"

#: ../../source/design.rst:156
msgid "Single object"
msgstr "单个对象"

#: ../../source/design.rst:158
msgid ""
"Each object has a unique name within the package (across all object "
"types). The object can be globally identified using ``\"<package-path"
">:<object-name>\"``."
msgstr "每个对象在包内（跨所有对象类型）都有一个唯一的名称。该对象可以使用 ``\"<package-path>:<object-name>\"`` 进行全局标识。"

#: ../../source/design.rst:161
msgid ""
"An attempt to reference an object using the object-name alone is "
"considered a reference to the object in the current package."
msgstr "如果尝试仅使用对象名称来引用一个对象，则会被视为对当前包中该对象的引用。"

#: ../../source/design.rst:165
msgid "Multiple objects"
msgstr "多个对象"

#: ../../source/design.rst:167
msgid ""
"Some PartCAD commands and interfaces allow referencing multiple objects "
"at once. ``\"<single-or-multiple-package-path>/:\\*\"`` is a reference to"
" all objects in ``\"<single-or-multiple-package-path>\"``."
msgstr "某些 PartCAD 命令和接口允许一次性引用多个对象。 ``\"<single-or-multiple-package-path>/:\\*\"`` 表示对 ``\"<single-or-multiple-package-path>\"`` 中所有对象的引用。"

#: ../../source/design.rst:173
msgid "Parametrized objects"
msgstr "参数化对象"

#: ../../source/design.rst:175
msgid ""
"Some objects (such as *sketches*, *parts*, *assemblies*, *interfaces* and"
" *providers*) may have parameters specified within the object ID to "
"identify an instantiation of the object with the given parameters: "
"``\"<package-path>:<object-name>;param1=value1,param2=value2\"``."
msgstr "某些对象（例如 *草图* 、 *零件* 、 *装配体* 、 *接口* 和 *提供方* ）可以在对象 ID 中指定参数，以标识带有给定参数的对象实例： ``\"<package-path>:<object-name>;param1=value1,param2=value2\"`` 。"

#: ../../source/design.rst:192
msgid "Objects in a cart"
msgstr "购物车中的对象"

#: ../../source/design.rst:194
msgid ""
"Whenever an object (a *part* or an *assembly*) is used for manufacturing "
"or ordering from a store, the object ID may optionally contain the "
"quantity: ``\"<package-path>:<object-"
"name>;param1=value1,param2=value2#<quantity>\"``."
msgstr "每当一个对象（一个 *零件* 或一个 *装配体* ）被用于制造或从商店订购时，其对象 ID 可以选择性地包含数量： ``\"<package-path>:<object-name>;param1=value1,param2=value2#<quantity>\"`` 。"

#: ../../source/design.rst:207
msgid "The public repository"
msgstr "公共仓库"

#: ../../source/design.rst:209
msgid ""
"The public PartCAD repository is created and maintained by the community "
"based on the PartCAD standards and conventions. It is hosted on `GitHub "
"<https://github.com/partcad/partcad-index>`_."
msgstr "公共 PartCAD 仓库由社区依据 PartCAD 标准与约定创建和维护。它托管在 `GitHub <https://github.com/partcad/partcad-index>`_ 上。"

#: ../../source/design.rst:213
msgid ""
"The top levels of the package hierarchy are expected to be maintained by "
"the PartCAD community. Lower levels of the hierarchy are expected to be "
"maintained by vendors and other communities. PartCAD community does not "
"aim to achieve the uniqueness of parts and assemblies. Moreover, everyone"
" is invited to provide their alternative models as long as they provide a"
" different level of model quality or different level of package quality "
"management processes, and as long the package data properly reflects the "
"quality that the maintainer provides and commits to maintain. This way "
"PartCAD users have a choice of which model to use based on their specific"
" needs."
msgstr "包层级结构的顶层部分预计将由 PartCAD 社区维护。层级中较低的部分则预计由供应商和其他社区维护。PartCAD 社区并不追求让零件和装配体保持唯一。此外，只要能够提供不同层次的模型质量或不同层次的包质量管理流程，并且只要包数据能够如实反映维护者所提供并承诺维护的质量，就欢迎任何人提供他们自己的替代模型。这样一来，PartCAD 用户就可以根据自身的具体需求来选择使用哪个模型。"

#: ../../source/design.rst:226
msgid "Tools"
msgstr "工具"

#: ../../source/design.rst:228
msgid ""
"PartCAD tools can operate with public and private repositories for as "
"long as they are maintained following the PartCAD standards and "
"conventions."
msgstr "只要公共和私有仓库遵循 PartCAD 标准与约定进行维护，PartCAD 工具就可以对其进行操作。"

#: ../../source/design.rst:232
msgid "Command line tools"
msgstr "命令行工具"

#: ../../source/design.rst:234
msgid ""
"PartCAD CLI tools get installed using the PyPI module ``partcad-cli``. "
"The main tool is called ``pc``. The CLI tools are supposed to provide the"
" complete set of PartCAD features."
msgstr "PartCAD 的 CLI 工具通过 PyPI 模块 ``partcad-cli`` 安装。主工具称为 ``pc`` 。这些 CLI 工具旨在提供 PartCAD 的完整功能集。"

#: ../../source/design.rst:239
msgid "Visual Studio Code extension"
msgstr "Visual Studio Code 扩展"

#: ../../source/design.rst:241
msgid "PartCAD extension for ``vscode`` is designed to be the primary tool to"
msgstr "面向 ``vscode`` 的 PartCAD 扩展被设计为主要工具，用于"

#: ../../source/design.rst:246
msgid "Libraries and frameworks"
msgstr "库和框架"

#: ../../source/design.rst:249
msgid "Python"
msgstr "Python"

#: ../../source/design.rst:251
msgid ""
"The `partcad` Python module is the first PartCAD library. Its development"
" is prioritized due to the popularity and the value proposition of such "
"Python frameworks such as CadQuery and build123d."
msgstr "`partcad` Python 模块是第一个 PartCAD 库。由于 CadQuery 和 build123d 等 Python 框架的流行及其价值主张，它的开发被优先考虑。"

#: ../../source/design.rst:256
msgid "Other languages"
msgstr "其他语言"

#: ../../source/design.rst:258
msgid ""
"PartCAD does not aim to stop at supporting Python. Native libraries in "
"other languages are planned and all contributors wishing to join the "
"project are welcome."
msgstr "PartCAD 并不打算止步于支持 Python。我们计划提供其他语言的原生库，并欢迎所有希望加入本项目的贡献者。"
